## DESCRIPTION
## Answer is any solution to an equation
## ENDDESCRIPTION
## DBsubject(WeBWorK)
## DBchapter(WeBWorK tutorial)
## DBsection(PGML tutorial 2015)
## Date(06/01/2015)
